{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226230","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:8:1222623001:1":{"text":"좋아. 역시 제대로 도망쳤군.","source_cn":"很好，她成功逃走了，没有辜负我故意弄松的绳索。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57C76516C2DA54D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222623002:0":{"text":"어서 쫓아가요! 만약 정말 도망쳤다면 본전도 못 찾게 될 거라고욥!","source_cn":"我们赶紧追上去吧！万一她真的逃跑，那可得不偿失了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C71F647E4D713F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222623003:0":{"text":"치피! 이봐... 치피, 치피!","source_cn":"满满——喂……满满，满满！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD47BD9D7189D9D57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222623004:0":{"text":"쿨쿨... 드르렁...","source_cn":"呼噜呼噜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92C3334C14268217","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222623005:1":{"text":"<shk>치피!!</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>满满！！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D1A3611C6C8DDDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222623006:1":{"text":"응? 왜? 뭐야! 날 밝았어?","source_cn":"啊！嗯？什么！天亮了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77B1AF95AE201DAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222623007:1":{"text":"바보 치피!!! 연기하기로 해놓고 정말 잠들면 어떡해!","source_cn":"满满大笨蛋！说好了是演戏，你怎么真的睡着了呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89B8D9B7F1070E54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222623008:1":{"text":"미안해!\n처음엔 자는 척을 했었는데... 자는 척을 하다가, 하다가...","source_cn":"对不起！\\n我一开始是装睡……但装着装着，就……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D58C4977E72034A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222623009:1":{"text":"하하하! 괜찮아. 보니는 눈치가 빠르고 조심스러워서 오히려 정말 잠든 덕분에 의심을 사지 않았을 테니.","source_cn":"哈哈哈！没关系。波妮警觉谨慎，你没装睡，而是真的睡着了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6D6AD44CEE48466","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222623010:1":{"text":"지금 바로 쫓아가면 분명 붙잡을 수 있을 거야!","source_cn":"我们立刻追上去，一定会让她措手不及！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88284A36FFAF283D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:20:12602210:0":{"text":"우리가 잠든 틈을 타 보니는 속박을 풀고 도망쳤다.","source_cn":"趁着你们都睡着，波妮挣脱了束缚跑了。","stat